The IK retargeting engine in `retargeting/` originates from GMR and remains
substantially unmodified in places. Files that are wholly or largely upstream:

  retargeting/motion_retarget.py    upstream, with asimov-specific additions
  retargeting/kinematics_model.py   upstream, unmodified
  retargeting/utils/smpl.py         upstream base; the SMPL+H AMASS adapter,
                                    measured-height scaling and per-dataset
                                    framerate overrides are this project's
  retargeting/__init__.py           upstream re-export surface
  retargeting/params.py             rewritten for asimov; registry API is
                                    upstream's

