Removed third-party code
===============================================================================

Earlier versions of the upstream project vendored Ubisoft LAFAN1 utilities
under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0. That code has been removed from this project in full;
the single quaternion-product call that used it is now
`retargeting/utils/quat.py`, written for this project. No CC BY-NC-ND code
remains, and none of this repository is subject to those terms.

